# Cirrus Silo Farm (CIPlay cirrus_silo_farm): the plan The Rainmakers' second island, quest "The Seed Silos"
# The silos x -8..8 z 12..20 (3 m), silo three at 8 12 (its hatch at 8 8.6, the cage at 12.6 12), the farmhouse at
# -24..-19.5 z -17..-14, the pen x 12..24 z -14..-6 (the tool chest at 12 -4), the farm gate at 0 -28.
island Cirrus Silo Farm
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Seed Silos
wait 5
expect animals Goat 3
expect hidden silostore
walk 0 -34 to 0 -28 to 0 -22
zone farm_gate
expect step 1
open Farm tool chest
expect item NetGun 1
catch Goat 3
expect step 2
read Farmer Teo's letter to his daughter
expect step 3
use silohatch
expect message locked
open Farmhouse drawer
expect story silokey 1
use silohatch
expect story silohatch 1
expect shown silostore
expect step 4
open Teo's seed box
expect message NOT THE COMPANY'S
open Silo 3 store
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_MotorWheel 1
expect item Blueprint_SteeringWheel 1
expect step 7
use teocage
expect survivor rainmakers_teo
expect story silokey 0
open Teo's seed box
expect item Seed_Pineapple 3
expect done
